OL,3,GNEWSAThe debating club that helped
OL,4,Ashape NHS architect Aneurin Bevan's
OL,5,Adrive for power
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the winter of 1921, a group of men
OL,8,Fgathered in a cafe in a small working
OL,9,Fclass town.
OL,11,FAlmost all were colliers used to the
OL,12,Fhard life hacking coal from the rich
OL,13,Fseams of the south Wales valleys - the
OL,14,Fregion that had powered the industrial
OL,15,Frevolution and underpinned the growth
OL,16,Fand wealth of the global British
OL,17,FEmpire.
OL,19,FBut few of the benefits of that wealth
OL,20,Fhad trickled down to the people who
OL,21,Fproduced it.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
